  "html": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-wrapper alignfull  root-eb-wrapper-a2nxa\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-wrapper-a2nxa \"><div class=\"eb-wrapper-outer eb-wrapper-a2nxa\"><div class=\"eb-wrapper-inner\"><div class=\"eb-wrapper-inner-blocks eb-wrapper-align-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-row alignfull  root-eb-row-pw1y5\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-row-pw1y5 \"><div class=\"eb-row-root-container eb-row-pw1y5\" data-id=\"eb-row-pw1y5\"><div class=\"eb-row-wrapper\"><div class=\"eb-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-column  root-eb-column-9f8jt\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-column-9f8jt \"><div class=\"eb-column-wrapper eb-column-9f8jt\"><div class=\"eb-column-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-649ac6b\" data-block-id=\"649ac6b\"><style>.stk-649ac6b {margin-bottom:0px !important;}.stk-649ac6b .stk-img-wrapper{width:100% !important;height:320px !important;}</style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-837\" src=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n.jpg\" width=\"1538\" height=\"2048\" srcset=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n.jpg 1538w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n-225x300.jpg 225w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n-769x1024.jpg 769w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n-768x1023.jpg 768w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n-1154x1536.jpg 1154w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1538px) 100vw, 1538px\" /></span></figure></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-advanced-heading  root-eb-advance-heading-xv8x1j5\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-advance-heading-xv8x1j5 eb_animation eb___animated eb___fadeInLeft\"><div class=\"eb-advance-heading-wrapper eb-advance-heading-xv8x1j5 button-1 undefined\" data-id=\"eb-advance-heading-xv8x1j5\"><h2 class=\"eb-ah-title\"><span class=\"first-title\">𝐀𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐞𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐨𝐫𝐢 𝐝𝐢𝐧 𝐁𝐨𝐭𝐨𝐬̦𝐚𝐧𝐢, 𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐠𝐚̆𝐭𝐢𝐭̦𝐢-𝐯𝐚̆ 𝐩𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐮 𝐨 𝐢̂𝐧𝐭𝐚̂𝐥𝐧𝐢𝐫𝐞 𝐝𝐞 𝐢𝐦𝐩𝐚𝐜𝐭!</span></h2><p class=\"eb-ah-subtitle\">Miercuri, 12 februarie 2025, ne reunim la C&amp;A Connect pentru o sesiune de networking, educație și descoperirea unor oportunități strategice pentru business-urile noastre.<br><br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb0/1/16/1f3af.png\" alt=\"🎯\"> Momentul de educație: Îl avem alături pe Cojocaru Cristian, un profesionist cu peste 16 ani de experiență în industria IT și high-tech gaming, dar și un lider vizionar în procesul de digitalizare și accesare de fonduri europene nerambursabile.<br><br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf3/1/16/1f539.png\" alt=\"🔹\"> 𝐃𝐞 𝐜𝐞 𝐬𝐚̆ 𝐯𝐢𝐢?<br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\"> Descoperi cum digitalizarea îți poate crește eficiența și competitivitatea.<br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\"> Afli ce fonduri europene sunt disponibile pentru afacerea ta și cum le poți accesa.<br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\"> Înveți pași concreți pentru a transforma tehnologia într-un avantaj real.<br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\"> Ai acces la o comunitate puternică de antreprenori cu care poți schimba idei și oportunități.<br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\"> Te încarci cu energie, inspirație și soluții aplicabile imediat!<br><br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"📍\"> Unde? Sediul <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/caconnectsrl?__cft__[0]=AZXQd-GyXJBxaP8NW1rlcp7AbTUEHW4zcIGDkf7PJgaNzbm7jF38rlKIgWNlhcdGjMCbj4FjCPG5NHvi_z2NI9plNYIV4uCMT3kyaFRkdSUl31EnQLnoorth4yKUR7rEXW3Bw0XwcQyg_R10Q3kmECqCzYoy2hGsZJ19vh_QeuHBlKNAhaoljfaYSEZdTek8tbkqIUdWoz0UTOLmlR6FbEUjL0Gs_fgHN1tp6mM08HZ7rg&amp;__tn__=-]K-y-R\">C&amp;A CONNECT SRL</a>, Strada Doboșari 79, Botoșani 710023<br><br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t3c/1/16/1f4a1.png\" alt=\"💡\"> Înscrie-te acum și hai să ne dezvoltăm împreună!</p></div></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-column  root-eb-column-p9dqq\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-column-p9dqq \"><div class=\"eb-column-wrapper eb-column-p9dqq\"><div class=\"eb-column-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-advanced-heading neobot_categorytitle  root-eb-advance-heading-o01u6\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-advance-heading-o01u6 eb_animation eb___animated eb___fadeInRight\"><div class=\"eb-advance-heading-wrapper eb-advance-heading-o01u6 button-1 undefined\" data-id=\"eb-advance-heading-o01u6\"><h5 class=\"eb-ah-title\"><span class=\"first-title\">Categorii populare</span></h5></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-feature-list root-eb-feature-list-l1a99uy\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-feature-list-l1a99uy eb_animation eb___animated eb___fadeInRight\"><div class=\"eb-feature-list-l1a99uy eb